==Battleground==
*4 [[Pigge Back]]s spawn, delay 15~30 seconds<sup>450f~900f</sup>.
*8 [[Pigge]]s (1,200%) spawn after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>, delay 10~20 seconds<sup>300f~600f</sup>.
*1 [[St. Pigge the 2nd]] spawns after 40 seconds<sup>1,200f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Pigge]] (100%) spawns as the boss.
**Infinite [[Pigge]]s (1,200%) spawn, delay 16.67~33.33 seconds<sup>500f~1,000f</sup>.
**4 [[Pigge Back]]s spawn, delay 26.67~40 seconds<sup>800f~1,200f</sup>.
**3 [[Zigge]]s spawn, delay 26.67~30 seconds<sup>800f~900f</sup>.
**2 [[Elizabeth the LVIth]]s spawn, delay 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>.

==Strategy==
Having most of the [[Anti-unstarred Alien Treasures]] from [[Into the Future]] is highly recommended for this stage.

As for the battle itself, bring 3-4 meatshields as well as a [[:Category:Wave Shield Cats|Wave Blocker]] such as [[Kotatsu Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Octopus Cat]] if available.

==Trivia==
*This stage used to contain a [[Shadow Boxer K]] spawning after 3,500 frames.

